{
  title: "339 a lens path in a function body carries no checker hint"
  doc: "eu-oaz72.183: the desugarer attaches a `__type_hint` to a lens
        path for the type checker. It is checker-only and must not reach
        run time, including where the path is a function's body (compiled
        as a body rather than as a binding)."
  import: "resource:lens"
}

h(z): ‹ :a ›

hint-free: (h(1) meta) = {}
focus: view(h(1), { a: 7 })

checks: {
  no-hint-in-function-body: hint-free
  lens-still-works: focus = 7
}

RESULT: checks values all-true? then(:PASS, :FAIL)
